---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import { buildWaLink } from '../lib/format';

const site = await getEntry('settings', 'site');
if (!site) throw new Error('settings/site entry not found');
const waMitraLink = buildWaLink(site.data.waNumber, 'Halo, saya tertarik untuk bergabung sebagai Mitra Dapur UMKM di bagiberbagi.id.');
const waCsrLink = buildWaLink(site.data.waNumber, 'Halo, kami tertarik menjalankan program CSR Korporasi bersama bagiberbagi.id.');
---

<section id="tentang" class="section">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-xl mb-10">
      <div class="eyebrow">BERGABUNG LEBIH JAUH</div>
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm md:text-heading-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3">Bangun Dampak Bersama</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-base">Tidak hanya sebagai donatur. Anda juga dapat bergabung sebagai:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-7">
      <div class="flex-1 basis-[420px] min-w-[280px] bg-brand-orangeTint rounded-card p-7 md:p-9 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1" data-fade="1">
        <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-2xl bg-ink flex items-center justify-center mb-5 text-brand-yellow">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 21h8M9 21v-6M15 21v-6M6 10a4 4 0 0 1 3-6.8A4 4 0 0 1 12 2a4 4 0 0 1 3 1.2A4 4 0 0 1 18 10c0 2-1 3-2 4H8c-1-1-2-2-2-4Z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold mb-2.5">Jadi Mitra Dapur UMKM</h3>
        <p class="text-body text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4.5">Dapatkan order pasti setiap minggu. Kami bantu standar higienitas dan kemasan. Anda fokus memasak.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 mb-6">
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-muted"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5 text-brand-orange"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Order berulang &amp; bayar tepat waktu</div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-muted"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5 text-brand-orange"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Pendampingan sertifikasi higiene</div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-muted"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5 text-brand-orange"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Branding usaha di laporan donatur</div>
        </div>
        <a href={waMitraLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block btn-primary">Bergabung Jadi Mitra</a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 basis-[420px] min-w-[280px] bg-brand-blue text-white rounded-card p-7 md:p-9 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1" data-fade="1">
        <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.18] flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="1"></rect><path d="M9 8h.01M9 12h.01M9 16h.01M15 8h.01M15 12h.01M15 16h.01"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold mb-2.5">CSR Korporasi</h3>
        <p class="text-body leading-relaxed opacity-90 mb-4.5">Jalankan program Jumat Berkah atas nama perusahaan — kami yang mengeksekusi dari dapur hingga laporan.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 mb-6">
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Laporan dampak profesional &amp; video</div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Branding perusahaan pada kemasan</div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 text-sm"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="flex-none mt-0.5"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> Skala fleksibel sesuai kebutuhan perusahaan Anda</div>
        </div>
        <a href={waCsrLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block btn-secondary">Hubungi Tim Kemitraan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
